 "PBw4SHZw3cbPHqdd-PB74jDrfyLYQSdW6-LB0MPjXhlNNVdnZn": "It means so much to have you\nwith us as we begin this new chapter.\nOn these pages you will find everything about the day — the ceremony and the dinner, how to get there, where to stay, and a little more.\n\nSee you in Tuscany,",
