 "PBw4SHZw3cbPHqdd-PBNxMQnfcNSk5MPk-LBsstc9LTNsklBl6": "Think relaxed garden elegance: light fabrics and soft shades of sage, olive, cream and warm gold feel right at home here",
 "PBw4SHZw3cbPHqdd-PBNxMQnfcNSk5MPk-LB6ygBpt7pBZDdLv": "Where to Stay\n",
 "PBw4SHZw3cbPHqdd-PBNxMQnfcNSk5MPk-LBtWNF4j32RLZZ8s": "To make your stay easy, we are holding a small number of rooms at two places we love, both a short drive from the villa through the Tuscan hills:",
 "PBw4SHZw3cbPHqdd-PBNxMQnfcNSk5MPk-LBvFQfZdKJ7gN15n": "Casa dei Cipressi",
 "PBw4SHZw3cbPHqdd-PBNxMQnfcNSk5MPk-LB14RRw5yQQCLZB4": "A restored stone farmhouse among cypress trees, with quiet rooms and wide valley views.",
 "PBw4SHZw3cbPHqdd-PBNxMQnfcNSk5MPk-LBYBrgYyyFQjrCh9": "\nbook here\n",
 "PBw4SHZw3cbPHqdd-PBNxMQnfcNSk5MPk-LB0qGgZbpwyKBfX0": "Hotel La Pergola",
 "PBw4SHZw3cbPHqdd-PBNxMQnfcNSk5MPk-LB6Zh3BmfVc7LtYx": "A family-run hotel with a vine-covered terrace, ten minutes from Villa Oliveto.",
 "PBw4SHZw3cbPHqdd-PBNxMQnfcNSk5MPk-LBS0dPtr0yHnnM05": "\nbook here\n",
 "PBw4SHZw3cbPHqdd-PBNxMQnfcNSk5MPk-LB19QYdz3tTcdf06": "Rooms are held for our guests at a special rate until 18 July 2027.\nPlease mention the THEO & CLARA wedding when you make your booking.",
 "PBw4SHZw3cbPHqdd-PB0yWdvQxNhGZPZQ-LBCSLK3lgBvLZPWM": "Kindly Rsvp",
 "PBw4SHZw3cbPHqdd-PB0yWdvQxNhGZPZQ-LBtNL4xsqQ0Hr2jC": "Please tell us whether you can make it no later than 18 JULY 2027",
 "PBw4SHZw3cbPHqdd-PB0yWdvQxNhGZPZQ-LB5zj8ZzL4bHPJxm": "Any questions? Write to us at:\nhello@theoandclara.com",
 "PBw4SHZw3cbPHqdd-PB8rV2yHB467ffCP-LBmSj3C9V8LkCKgq": "Gifts & Wishes",
 "PBw4SHZw3cbPHqdd-PB8rV2yHB467ffCP-LBfmYgR80PZgBhjs": "Having you with us is the only gift we need.\nShould you still like to give something, a small gift list and our honeymoon fund are waiting here.",
